{"id":"b15ebe94f199828c","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-omega-consistency.md","title":"Omega Consistency of an Arithmetic System","display":"df-omega-consistency — Omega Consistency of an Arithmetic System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-omega-consistency","aliases":["92-df-omega-consistency"],"display":"df-omega-consistency — Omega Consistency of an Arithmetic System","source":"第 V 章 pp. 56–57、61–63（PDF 73–74、78–80）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","[[92-df-formula-instance]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","[[92-df-signature]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-omega-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-omega-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-omega-consistency — Omega Consistency of an Arithmetic System"},{"key":"source","html":"第 V 章 pp. 56–57、61–63（PDF 73–74、78–80）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"62f011418ee9c44e\" href=\"?note=62f011418ee9c44e\" title=\"92-df-arithmetic-system\">92-df-arithmetic-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd18c4d476f594a\" href=\"?note=8bd18c4d476f594a\" title=\"92-df-formula-instance\">92-df-formula-instance</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" href=\"?note=b9e3d57e94ce36b7\" title=\"92-df-free-variable-function\">92-df-free-variable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>；本地固定系统 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 是其特例。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\mathrm{Var}_G,\\mathrm{FV}_G,\\mathrm{Subst}_G,\\bar n,\\vdash\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\mathrm{Var}_G,\\mathrm{FV}_G,\\mathrm{Subst}_G,\\bar n,\\vdash\\)</span> 采用上述依赖的语法、代入、数码和可证性。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span> 是下文定义的系统谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\n\\neg\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\,\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\exists x\\,F\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(F,\\bar n,x)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\n\\neg\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\,\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\exists x\\,F\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(F,\\bar n,x)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将原有固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的定义扩展到同一语法上的算术系统，保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> 的含义。普通一致性在这里显式列出；在经典逻辑背景下，不一致系统本就会满足被禁止的存在句及全部反实例，所以该列项是冗余的，未增加原书定义的实质强度。</p>\n<p>原书第一条 Gödel 不可证侧只用普通一致性，不可反驳侧才用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 一致性。它与外部“所有自然数实例为真”或系统内证明全称句不同；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 规则也不是这一定义自动提供的规则。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 V 章 pp. 56–57、61–63（PDF 73–74、78–80）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetic-system","status":"resolved","id":"62f011418ee9c44e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetic-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula-instance","status":"resolved","id":"8bd18c4d476f594a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula-instance]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-free-variable-function","status":"resolved","id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-free-variable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_G,\\mathrm{Var}_G,\\mathrm{FV}_G,\\mathrm{Subst}_G,\\bar n,\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}omega\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\n\\neg\\exists F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\,\\exists x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_G(F)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\land\n\\mathcal S\\vdash\\exists x\\,F\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathcal S\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Subst}_G(F,\\bar n,x)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false}],"bytes":1980,"backlinks":[{"id":"c1547d2395ecc99c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (omega-consistency predicate, see [[92-df-omega-consistency]])"},{"id":"28f4d899d4e85281","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (omega-consistency predicate, see [[92-df-omega-consistency]])"},{"id":"8086f2be7f666ab6","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con},1\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con},\\mathrm{Con}$ (consistency predicates, see [[92-df-omega-consistency]], [[92-df-1-consistency]], [[92-df-consistent]])"},{"id":"916836dbb5b34f34","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (omega-consistency predicate, see [[92-df-omega-consistency]])"},{"id":"2121ca396d7d67ab","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-57","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-representability]]、[[92-df-enumerability-in-system]]、[[92-lem-omega-enumeration]]与[[92-df-omega-consistency]]给出原书关于表示和 $\\omega$ 相容性的契约。本地固定 PA 的对应结果见[[92-thm-first-incompleteness]]与[[92-thm-omega-incompleteness]]。"},{"id":"a944261792aad989","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (omega consistency, see [[92-df-omega-consistency]])"},{"id":"3402731b38b2c005","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (omega-consistency predicate, see [[92-df-omega-consistency]])"},{"id":"f9c46ba810e9de83","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (omega consistency, see [[92-df-omega-consistency]])"},{"id":"02b34261c2cb199c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (omega consistency, see [[92-df-omega-consistency]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-omega-consistency]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-omega-consistency]]"}],"outgoing":["62f011418ee9c44e","8bd18c4d476f594a","c7befd96bd551ade","b9e3d57e94ce36b7","d666a3e3ee6c8148"]}